{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6SMDF1FGH9T1W9CJ71QY47M"},{"$ref":"01M6SMDF1FCY3GJ5NHBZB4R7YA"},{"$ref":"01M6SMDF1F61P0R2R097N4Y16D"}],"opens":"A feed is a file polled, a relay polls it for many, and the holder tracks no one; glass's store is already this shape, one line of a ref polled and only new packs fetched. Relays are stores, checked by the hash of each commit, and may follow relays.","restsOn":["a hash per commit","relays as unions of stores"],"stands":"noted","title":"Following without being weighed"},"id":"01M6SMDF1G99FVJER5B9DJNYX5","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
